{
  "id": "ISA.65",
  "number": "65",
  "bookId": "ISA",
  "reference": "Isaya 65",
  "verseCount": 25,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "65",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ISA 65"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "65",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama akagamba ati, “Nkaba nyetekatekire kuhorora abantu bange, nawe tibanshabire. Nkaba nyetekatekire kabampiga bakambona, kyonkai tibampigire. Eihanga elitanshabire nkaligambira nti, ‘Leba, ndiho ndi aha!’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omushana gwona nasibaga nyimukize emikono kwakilira eihanga elitalikunshengera, abakora ebitalibyo, shana ebyo bonene benzire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eihanga elyo nilinnigaza buli kanya. Nibatamba ebitambo by'ekitakansi omu busitani, nibotera obunuma aha alutare z'ekitakansi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu kiro nibagya omu nyanga n'omu mpako kuraguza aha bizimu by'abafu. Omu bikwato byabo nituliramu enyama y'engurube n'okunyweramu omuchuzi gw'enyama y'ebitambo eby'ekitakansi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nibagambira abandi bati, ‘Mutwilire harai, muramanya mutatukwataho, kuba tuli batakatifu!’ Abantu aba ngeli egi inye tindikubemera. Ekiniga kyange ahali bonene kili nk'omuliro ogutarara.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Naramwire ekibonabonio ekyo ndabaha, mara ekibonabonio ekyo kihandikirwe. Ebyo bakozire nimbyekomya; ndababonabonyia ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aha rw'amafu gabo n'aga baish'enkurubo. Boteire obunuma omu buju bw'ekitakansi omu nshozi bashuba bangamba kubi. Kityo ninyija kubabonabonyia kuhonderana n'amafu gabo ago bakozire.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama nagamba ati, “Nk'okwo edivai eshangwa eli omu zabibu, bakagira bati, ‘Ezabibu ezo mutakuzita, aha rw'okuba zinamu omugisha,’ nanye nikwo ndagira aha rw'abairu bange, timbaite bona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaisiraeli ab'oruganda rwa Yuda ndibaha omugisha, kandi baijukuru babo tulilya ensi yange ey'amabanga. Eihanga lyange elironkwa, elinkolera, tulitura omwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balinfukamira, entaama zabo n'ente zabo barazilisizaga omu muteleka gwa Sharoni, n'omu Ruhanga rwa Akori nimwo zilibyama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyonkai inywe abansigireho mukebwa n'eibanga lyange elitakatifu, mukafukamira Gadi na Meni baruhanga ab'omugisha n'ebasha, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ndabaanaga aha mbanda; inywe barabakindura. Kuba nkabeta timwamporoire; nagamba timwahulira, mwangokera, mwakora ebilikuntaama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aha rw'ekyo leba, abairu bange baranywa balye, kyonkai inywe mwitwe enjara n'eiliho. Barashemelerwa kyonkai inywe enshoni zirabaita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baragira ebyera bazine, kyonkai inywe mugire obujune n'obushasi bungi muno muchure muboroge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu ndonkwa zange inywe muliba baraamwa, inye Omukama Ruhanga ninyija kubaita inywe. Kyonkai abairu bange ndabeta eibara elihya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuntu omu nsi aligonza omugisha, aligushaba ahali Ruhanga Omwesigwa. Kandi wena wena aligonza kunahira, alinahira obuso bwa Ruhanga Omwesigwa. Enaku ez'eirai zilihwa mara zebeke.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama nagamba ati, “Leba, naija kutonda eiguru elihya n'ensi empya. Ebyabaireho ruli tibikiijukwa rundi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shana ekiliho mushanduke, mushemelerwe ebyo naija kutonda. Yerusalemu empya eyo naija kutonda eraba y'ebyera bingi, kandi n'abantu bamwo baragira amashemelerwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na inye nyenene Yerusalemu eranshemelera, n'abantu bamwo baraba byera byange. Omuli Yerusalemu takihulirwamu kuchura na kutaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tihakifamu nkelemeke, nangu n'omugurusi atakuzire akahangara chei. Omuntu arataga kufa aina emyaka kikumi, kyonkai abafakare abaramwa emyaka kikumi tibagigobyega. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Barayombekaga amaju bagaturemu, babyare emizabibu bagilyeho ebiraba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tibalyombeka maju ga kwija kuturwamu bandi; titulibyara mizabibu kandi ezabibu zikalibwa bandi. Abantu bange barahangaraga nk'emiti, kandi endonkwa zange zilishemelerwa ebyo zekoleire ebiro birai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebyo tulikora titulihendekera bushai, kandi abaana babo titulibona kabi. Bonene na baijukuru babo ndabahaga omugisha amakiro gona agalija. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nangu batakamanyire kunshaba inye ndiba nabahoroire, batakamazire kugamba inye ndiba nabahuliire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omushega gulilya n'omwana gw'entaama, kandi entare elilya obunyasi nk'ente. Kyonkai enjoka egyo eralyaga eitaka. Taliho kilihutaza kinu omuli Sioni, eibanga lyange elitakatifu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
